+# Changelog
+
+## [2026-09-24]
+
+### Added
+
+- **CODEX:** Added Deslopify browser coverage for lantern ignition, wall toggles, shader errors, and restart.
+- **CODEX:** Added Deslopify restart key handling with flow, lantern, player, and atmosphere reset.
+
+### Changed
+
+- **CODEX:** Kept Deslopify lantern light visible in first-person view through a scene-level hand socket.
+- **CODEX:** Corrected Deslopify demo copy to describe its south-bank-to-wall journey.
